*.xcuserstate

# Per-user Xcode state. `*.xcuserstate` above was not enough: the other three
# files in these directories are tracked, and `gitignore` does not apply to a
# path that is already tracked — so every one of them kept showing up as a
# modification in unrelated commits. Matches `.gitignore` inside a fresh Xcode
# project, which is where `*.xcuserstate` came from.
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserdatad/
*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/